### Sample requests for the Werkstatt API (VS Code "REST Client" extension).
### Fill in the variables; get a token via client credentials (see docs/SETUP-BC.md).

@tenantId = <tenant-guid>
@environment = sandbox
@companyId = <company-guid>
@token = <access-token>
@base = https://api.businesscentral.dynamics.com/v2.0/{{tenantId}}/{{environment}}/api
@ws = {{base}}/schroeder/werkstatt/v1.0/companies({{companyId}})

### Get token (client credentials)
POST https://login.microsoftonline.com/{{tenantId}}/oauth2/v2.0/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=<client-id>&client_secret=<secret>&scope=https://api.businesscentral.dynamics.com/.default

### Companies (standard API)
GET {{base}}/v2.0/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Service orders changed since a timestamp (delta sync)
GET {{ws}}/serviceOrders?$filter=lastModifiedDateTime gt 2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&$top=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Service order items of one order
GET {{ws}}/serviceOrderItems?$filter=documentNumber eq 'SA-000123'
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inventory per location for an item
GET {{ws}}/itemAvailabilities?$filter=itemNumber eq '1000' and locationCode eq 'WILD'
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create resource line (time) - idempotent; send twice, the second call returns the same line
POST {{ws}}/serviceLines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monteurAppId": "6f1c3a1e-2b7d-4a77-9a55-0c1f9d1e0001",
  "documentNumber": "SA-000123",
  "serviceItemLineNumber": 10000,
  "type": "Resource",
  "number": "R-MUELLER",
  "quantity": 1.75,
  "unitOfMeasureCode": "STUNDE",
  "workTypeCode": "ARBEIT"
}

### Create item line (12 l engine oil)
POST {{ws}}/serviceLines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monteurAppId": "6f1c3a1e-2b7d-4a77-9a55-0c1f9d1e0002",
  "documentNumber": "SA-000123",
  "serviceItemLineNumber": 10000,
  "type": "Item",
  "number": "OEL-15W40",
  "locationCode": "WILD",
  "quantity": 12,
  "unitOfMeasureCode": "L"
}

### Allocation (planning board)
POST {{ws}}/serviceOrderAllocations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monteurAppId": "6f1c3a1e-2b7d-4a77-9a55-0c1f9d1e0003",
  "documentNumber": "SA-000123",
  "serviceItemLineNumber": 10000,
  "resourceNumber": "R-MUELLER",
  "allocationDate": "2026-11-20",
  "startingTime": "08:00:00",
  "finishingTime": "11:00:00",
  "allocatedHours": 3
}

### Work report as comment line (max. 80 characters per line)
POST {{ws}}/serviceCommentLines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monteurAppId": "6f1c3a1e-2b7d-4a77-9a55-0c1f9d1e0004",
  "type": "Resolution",
  "documentNumber": "SA-000123",
  "serviceItemLineNumber": 10000,
  "date": "2026-11-20",
  "comment": "Wartung nach Herstellerplan durchgeführt, Öle und Filter gewechselt."
}

### Absence (one line per working day)
POST {{ws}}/employeeAbsences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monteurAppId": "6f1c3a1e-2b7d-4a77-9a55-0c1f9d1e0005",
  "employeeNumber": "M-0042",
  "fromDate": "2026-11-23",
  "toDate": "2026-11-23",
  "causeOfAbsenceCode": "URLAUB",
  "unitOfMeasureCode": "TAG",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Set order status after master approval (needs current @odata.etag)
PATCH {{ws}}/serviceOrders(<systemId>)
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: <etag>

{ "status": "Finished" }

### Deletions since cursor
GET {{ws}}/deletedRecords?$filter=deletedAt gt 2026-11-19T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Webhook subscription on service orders (standard subscription endpoint)
POST {{base}}/v2.0/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notificationUrl": "https://<monteur-app-api>/bc/webhook",
  "resource": "/api/schroeder/werkstatt/v1.0/companies({{companyId}})/serviceOrders",
  "clientState": "<shared-secret>"
}
